SUMMARY:🎪 Balmoral Show
DESCRIPTION:Northern Ireland's largest annual agri-food event\, in its 157t
 h year in 2026. Livestock competitions\, show jumping\, the NI Food Pavili
 on showcasing the best of local producers\, trade stands\, and family attr
 actions. The defining moment of the NI farming calendar.\n\nDates: 13–16 M
 ay 2026\nFocus: Agri-food\, livestock\, NI Food Pavilion\nMore info: https
 ://balmoralshow.co.uk/\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Eikon Exhibition Centre\, Lisburn
URL:https://balmoralshow.co.uk/
CATEGORIES:Festival\,Agriculture
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
