SUMMARY:🎪 Comber Earlies Food Festival
DESCRIPTION:The flagship celebration of Comber's PGI-protected new potatoes
 . Artisan food and drink stalls\, vintage tractor display\, celebrity chef
  demos (Anna Haugh in 2026)\, children's entertainment\, traditional bands
 . Drew 11\,000+ visitors in recent years. Free family event.\n\nDates: Sat
 urday 28 June 2026\, 11am–5pm\nFocus: PGI Comber Earlies new potatoes\nMor
 e info: https://www.visitardsandnorthdown.com/whats-on/event-highlights/co
 mber-earlies-food-festival\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Comber Leisure Centre\, Comber
URL:https://www.visitardsandnorthdown.com/whats-on/event-highlights/comber-
 earlies-food-festival
