SUMMARY:🎪 Portaferry Sails & Sounds Festival
DESCRIPTION:Classic boat and music festival on the Portaferry waterfront. T
 raditional and historic vessels gather in the lough narrows. Food and drin
 k vendors throughout the four days\, alongside live music and waterside pe
 rformances.\n\nDates: Early August (1–4 August in 2025)\nFocus: Waterside 
 food vendors\, music\, classic boats\nMore info: https://www.portaferrysai
 lsandsounds.com/\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Portaferry waterfront
URL:https://www.portaferrysailsandsounds.com/
CATEGORIES:Festival\,Food
