DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260901
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:🎪 Fermanagh Taste Experience
DESCRIPTION:A weekend showcase of Fermanagh's distinctive food culture — pa
 sture-fed beef\, freshwater lake fish\, farmhouse cheeses and the county's
  growing distilling scene. The lake country's answer to a food festival.\n
 \nDates: Late August\nFocus: Beef\, lake fish\, cheese\, distillery\nMore 
 info: https://www.fermanaghlakelands.com/\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Enniskillen\, County Fermanagh
URL:https://www.fermanaghlakelands.com/
CATEGORIES:Festival\,Food
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
