SUMMARY:🎪 Hillsborough International Oyster Festival
DESCRIPTION:A five-day celebration of the oyster in historic Hillsborough v
 illage. Gourmet food market\, oyster bars\, chef demonstrations\, and the 
 famous World Oyster Eating Championship. One of NI's most polished food ev
 ents — the village transforms.\n\nDates: Late August / early September\nFo
 cus: Oysters\, World Oyster Eating Championship\nMore info: https://www.fa
 cebook.com/HIOFestival\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Hillsborough\, County Down
URL:https://www.facebook.com/HIOFestival
CATEGORIES:Festival\,Food
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
