SUMMARY:🎪 Armagh Food & Cider Weekend
DESCRIPTION:Four days celebrating PGI Armagh Bramley Apples\, craft cider\,
  apple brandy and the orchard county's wider food culture. 50+ events incl
 uding the Bramley Banquet\, apple-picking tours\, woodland suppers\, exper
 t-led cider tastings and chef-led dinners.\n\nDates: 3–6 September 2026\nF
 ocus: PGI Bramley apples\, craft cider\, apple brandy\nMore info: https://
 visitarmagh.com/festivals/food-cider/\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Armagh City\, County Armagh
URL:https://visitarmagh.com/festivals/food-cider/
CATEGORIES:Festival\,Food
