DTSTAMP:20260603T162608Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:🎪 Portaferry Heritage Fest
DESCRIPTION:30+ events across three days celebrating the peninsula's histor
 y\, landscape and food culture. The standout for Ulster.food is the Wild A
 bout Foraging event at Kearney — forage\, cook and eat with wildlife exper
 t David Thompson and wild chef Celia Spouncer on the Strangford Lough shor
 e. A direct introduction to the foraging story.\n\nDates: 13–15 September\
 nFocus: Heritage\, foraging\, peninsula food culture\nMore info: https://s
 trangfordlough.org/news/launch-of-portaferry-heritage-fest/\n\nFull guide 
 at ulster.food
LOCATION:Portaferry\, Ards Peninsula
URL:https://strangfordlough.org/news/launch-of-portaferry-heritage-fest/
CATEGORIES:Festival\,Heritage
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
