DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:🎪 Strangford Lough Oyster Festival
DESCRIPTION:The oyster festival on the lough itself — smaller and more root
 ed than Hillsborough. Stalls and shucking displays along the Strangford wa
 terfront\, plus workshops on sustainable oyster farming and marine ecology
 . Oysters served come from certified local farms using sustainable methods
 .\n\nDates: Early to mid October\nFocus: Strangford Lough oysters\, sustai
 nable farming\nMore info: https://www.visitmournegullionstrangford.com/exp
 lore/cities-towns-and-villages/strangford/strangford-lough\n\nFull guide a
 t ulster.food
LOCATION:Strangford village\, County Down
URL:https://www.visitmournegullionstrangford.com/explore/cities-towns-and-v
 illages/strangford/strangford-lough
CATEGORIES:Festival\,Food
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
