SUMMARY:🎪 Bushmills Salmon & Whiskey Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrates the village's two great traditions — its wild salmon
  fishing heritage on the River Bush and the world-famous Bushmills distill
 ery. Three days of pairings\, tastings\, salmon dishes and whiskey events 
 in and around the village.\n\nDates: Early October (3–5 October in 2025)\n
 Focus: Wild salmon\, Bushmills whiskey\nMore info: https://www.visitcausew
 aycoastandglens.com/whats-on/bushmills-salmon-and-whiskey-festival\n\nFull
  guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Bushmills\, County Antrim
URL:https://www.visitcausewaycoastandglens.com/whats-on/bushmills-salmon-an
 d-whiskey-festival
CATEGORIES:Festival\,Drink
