  — bratwurst\, crêpes\, Belgian waffles\, paella and mulled wine\, alongsi
 de a growing presence of Northern Irish artisan producers. The defining Be
 lfast Christmas tradition.\n\nDates: Mid-November to late December\nFocus:
  European market food\, NI artisan producers\nMore info: https://visitbelf
 ast.com/\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
